WEBVTT

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.467
Are you a SMART fella...

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.533
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.800
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.733 --> 00:00:10.433
Question one! Which one does NOT

00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:13.467
belong? Robin... sparrow...

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:16.333
salmon... eagle. Is it A,

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:19.133
robin... B, sparrow...

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:21.467
C, salmon... or D,

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:24.167
eagle? Five seconds, go!

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:32.300
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.200
The answer is...

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.000
C, salmon! A robin,

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.200
a sparrow, and an eagle all

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.333
soar through the sky as birds.

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:42.367
But a salmon?

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:43.800
That one swims.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.367
It's a fish!

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.967
Question three, a picture puzzle!

00:00:48.967 --> 00:00:51.467
An empty circle becomes a filled-in

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:54.500
circle. So an empty square becomes...

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.967
which one? A,

00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:57.367
a filled square...

00:00:57.367 --> 00:00:59.700
B, an empty square...

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.567
C, a filled circle...

00:01:01.567 --> 00:01:04.000
or D, a filled triangle?

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.467
Five seconds!

00:01:10.967 --> 00:01:13.500
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:01:13.867 --> 00:01:15.267
The answer is...

00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:17.500
A, a filled square!

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:19.067
The rule is simple:

00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:20.667
the shape gets colored in,

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:23.033
but stays the very same shape.

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:26.367
Empty square becomes filled square!

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:29.767
Question seven, and this one is

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:32.467
tricky! Two, six,

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:35.300
twelve, twenty, thirty,

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.267
and then... what comes next?

00:01:38.367 --> 00:01:41.033
A, thirty-six... B,

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:44.233
forty... C, forty-two...

00:01:44.233 --> 00:01:46.600
or D, forty-four?

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:48.433
Five seconds on the clock!

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.633
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.333
The answer is...

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:01.300
C, forty-two! Look at the jumps:

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.300
plus four, plus six,

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.300
plus eight, plus ten.

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:07.467
The next jump is plus twelve,

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:10.600
and thirty plus twelve is forty-two!

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:14.600
So, are you smart or fart?

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:16.367
Count up your correct answers to

00:02:16.367 --> 00:02:18.000
find your rank!

00:02:18.933 --> 00:02:20.433
So, how did you do?

00:02:20.433 --> 00:02:21.867
Comment your score below,

00:02:21.867 --> 00:02:23.533
and follow for more!
